/E (Our design aims to address two aerodynamic challenges simultaneously. The first is to generate downforce. To achieve this, the car's aerodynamic surfaces, including the wings and the contours of the body, are designed to direct airflow in a way that generates a downward force. According to Newton's third law of motion, changes in the direction of airflow produce corresponding forces on the car. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
