/E (The Computer-Aided Manufacturing \(CAM\) stage focused on preparing selected components of our design for physical production. For this part of the project, we concentrated mainly on the front and rear wings, which were important elements of the car's appearance and aerodynamic design. After developing the digital designs, we used Creality Print to prepare the components for 3D printing.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
