315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (During the tests, we paid attention to how the car moved along the track and whether it maintained stable movement during its run. We also observed the general behavior of the vehicle to determine whether the assembled components appeared to function together as intended. These observations allowed us to evaluate the result of the work completed during the design, printing, and assembly stages.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Testing was particularly useful because it allowed us to assess the physical car rather than relying only on its digital appearance. A design that looks appropriate on a computer must still be evaluated once its components have been produced and assembled. By testing the actual vehicle, we could observe its performance and determine whether further modifications were necessary.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Figure 15. Final track test of the completed JAF Racing Team car to evaluate its speed and stability.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (We refined the front and rear wings by reviewing the first 3D-printed versions and identifying areas that could be improved. We adjusted their designs to achieve more suitable shapes, better integration with the car, and adequate resistance for handling and assembly. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (The final review focused on evaluating our JAF Racing Team car as a complete project. We checked the overall appearance, assembly quality, positioning of the components, and condition of the printed wings and halos. We also reviewed the stickers and color palette to ensure the car reflected our team's visual identity. Since we were satisfied with its speed and stability during track testing, we maintained the overall configuration without further structural changes. Finally, we considered the competition requirements and the objectives established by our team. This review helped us recognize the importance of combining digital design, component preparation, assembly, testing, and teamwork to achieve the final result.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
