/P 55 0 R
/E (Being part of the STEM Racing in Panama project for the first time has been an unforgettable experience for our entire team. Throughout this journey, we had the opportunity to learn new skills, explore our creativity, apply our knowledge of science, technology, engineering, and mathematics, and discover what it truly means to work together toward a common goal. )
/Pg 17 0 R
