333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (From designing our car and developing our ideas to manufacturing components, testing our prototype, and improving our design, every stage brought new challenges, lessons, and moments of excitement. Although some parts of the process were challenging, overcoming them as a team made the experience even more rewarding. We are especially grateful to Saint George International School of Panama for giving us the opportunity to participate in this project and for supporting us throughout our journey. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
334 0 obj
<<
